### Constraints
You will be given a input string that is one of the following

- A single English alphabet, represented by uppercase Roman alphabets 
- Z plus  A single English alphabet, or two times Z plus 20 (220-base system)
- A binary digit (0) and an English Alphabet
- a carry over case of binary value in range 0 to 4096 (1 otherwise)    

